    "macDecision": {
      "x": 1700,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 440,
      "size": "m",
      "fill": "orange",
      "page": "mac",
      "text": "OWNER DECISIONS: (1) No confirmation screen: whenever SettleIn opens with a selection (from the download or a settlein.dev link) it starts installing straight away, with Cancel and Change selection always in reach. Replaces C18 and screen A1. (2) Picking happens inside the app (A7) for Add apps, Change selection and first open with nothing installed. Replaces C16's open-the-website step. Full list: Handoff page."
    },
